9","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0144","start":144,"end":146,"surface":"子綦","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001936","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p054","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m055-0148","start":148,"end":150,"surface":"子綦","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001936","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p055","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji040-185","person_id":"cbr-p001936","surfaces":["子綦","王"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-040-chu"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p049","quote":"昭王亡也至雲夢。雲夢不知其王也，射傷王。王走鄖。鄖公之弟懷曰：「平王殺吾父，今我殺其子，不亦可乎？」鄖公止之，然恐其弒昭王，乃與王出奔隨。呉王聞昭王往，卽進撃隨，謂隨人曰：「周之子孫封於江漢之閒者，楚盡滅之。」欲殺昭王。王從臣子綦乃深匿王，自以爲王，謂隨人曰：「以我予呉。」隨人卜予呉，不吉，乃謝呉王曰：「昭王亡，不在隨。」呉請入自索之，隨不聽，呉亦罷去。"}],"rationale":" 子綦自以為王是替昭王隱匿冒稱，不代表昭王本人或取得王位。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p049","text":"昭王亡也至雲夢。雲夢不知其王也，射傷王。王走鄖。鄖公之弟懷曰：「平王殺吾父，今我殺其子，不亦可乎？」鄖公止之，然恐其弒昭王，乃與王出奔隨。呉王聞昭王往，卽進撃隨，謂隨人曰：「周之子孫封於江漢之閒者，楚盡滅之。」欲殺昭王。王從臣子綦乃深匿王，自以爲王，謂隨人曰：「以我予呉。」隨人卜予呉，不吉，乃謝呉王曰：「昭王亡，不在隨。」呉請入自索之，隨不聽，呉亦罷去。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m049-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m049-0013","start":13,"end":14,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m049-0018","start":18,"end":19,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m049-0020","start":20,"end":21,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provis