","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001936","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m049-0148","start":148,"end":150,"surface":"呉王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000424","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m049-0153","start":153,"end":155,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p054","text":"昭王病甚，乃召諸公子大夫曰：「孤不佞，再辱楚國之師，今乃得以天壽終，孤之幸也。」讓其弟公子申爲王，不可。又讓次弟公子結，亦不可。乃又讓次弟公子閭，五讓，乃後許爲王。將戰，庚寅，昭王卒於軍中。子閭曰：「王病甚，捨其子讓群臣，臣所以許王，以廣王意也。今君王卒，臣豈敢忘君王之意乎！」乃與子西、子綦謀，伏師閉涂，迎越女之子章立之，是爲惠王。然後罷兵歸，葬昭王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0043","start":43,"end":46,"surface":"公子申","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001937","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0047","start":47,"end":48,"surface":"王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"此王為讓位／答應為王的提議用語，不是昭王的指代；未由提議作實際即位、授予或身份用稱。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0056","start":56,"end":59,"surface":"公子結","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001938","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0069","start":69,"end":72,"surface":"公子閭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001939","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0080","start":80,"end":81,"surface":"王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"此王為讓位／答應為王的提議用語，不是昭王的指代；未由提議作實際即位、授予或身份用稱。"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0088","start":88,"end":90,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0095","start":95,"end":97,"surface":"子閭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001939","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0100","start":100,"end":101,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0115","start":115,"end":116,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0119","start":119,"end":120,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0124","start":124,"end":126,"surface":"君王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0132","start":132,"end":134,"surface":"君王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0141","start":141,"end":143,"surface":"子西","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001935","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0144","start":144,"end":146,"surface":"子綦","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001936","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0154","start":154,"end":156,"surface":"越女","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001961","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0157","start":157,"end":159,"surface":"子章","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001916","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0164","start":164,"end":166,"surface":"惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001916","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m054-0174","start":174,"end":176,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001915","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","book_id":"b-shiji-040","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p055","text":"惠王二年，子西召故平王太子建之子勝於呉，以爲巣大夫，號曰白公。白公好兵而下士，欲報仇。六年，白公請兵令尹子西伐鄭。初，白公父建亡在鄭，鄭殺之，白公亡走呉，子西復召之，故以此怨鄭，欲伐之。子西許而未爲發兵。八年，晉伐鄭，鄭告急楚，楚使子西救鄭，受賂而去。白公勝怒，乃遂與勇力死士石乞等襲殺令尹子西、子綦於朝，因劫惠王，置之髙府，欲弒之。惠王從者屈固負王亡走昭王夫人宮。白公自立爲王。月餘，會葉公來救楚，楚惠王之徒與共攻白公，殺之。惠王乃復位。是歳也，滅陳而縣之。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m055-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001916","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m055-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"子西","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001935","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m055-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"平王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001892","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m055-0011","start":11,"end":14,"surface":"太子建","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001929","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m055-0016","start":16,"end":17,"surface":"勝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001940","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m055-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"白公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001940","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m055-0031","start":31,"end":33,"surface":"白公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001940","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m055-0046","start":46,"end":48,"surface":"白公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001940","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m055-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"子西","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001935","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m055-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"白公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001940","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m055-0062","start":62,"end":63,"surface":"建","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001929","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m055-0071","start":71,"end":73,"surface":"白公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001940","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m055-0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"子西","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001935","status":"contextual_pr